      "q": "Where is Misty Villas located?",
      "a": "Misty Villas is on the Panchalimedu Hills near Kuttikanam in Idukki district, Kerala (PIN 685532). It is close to Parunthumpara viewpoint, Valanjanganam Waterfalls, Vagamon Pine Forest and Sita Devi Lake."
    },
    {
      "q": "What facilities does the resort offer?",
      "a": "A swimming pool, BBQ, campfire, and veg and non-veg meals for breakfast, lunch and dinner. Rooms have balconies with hill views."
